--[[
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    TRACKMATIC v1.0.1 PRODUCTION
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    intelligent procedural track builder for cherax.

    description:
    - builds tube races, road tracks, drift runs, parkour islands and hybrid courses in front of you
    - plans every course first (buildings, terrain, radius, object limit), then spawns it with a tetris-style drop-in
    - 90+ course styles per category, each one a tunable preset (tuner settings for tubes, track, parkour and hybrid)
    - live 3d preview and real hover previews from the same planner the build uses (no spawning)
    - saves tracks, graph settings and tuner values under cherax\lua\trackmatic
    - minigames, lab courses, saved-track library and 3d track graphs
    - optional auto start marker: a flag icon + gps line to the start on your map
    - colour picker for every builder: default, #1-#15, rainbow, random

    controls:
    - home is the default page: quick builds, last build, and switches like track ramp and auto start marker
    - tubes / track / parkour / hybrid: pick a course type, open tuner settings, press build
    - clear track removes the course and stops any build that is still planning or spawning
    - go to start puts you at the start of the latest course
    - online, only the session host gets the full menu; everyone else sees the home tab with a host message

    notes:
    - previous project names: Track Generator, RaceScape
    - 80 objects is the hard maximum for every builder (online players can't see more)
    - an untouched tuner builds exactly what the course type always built
    - map icons only show for you; other players see networked props and effects
    - the build log keeps one [BUILD] start / end line per build

    changelog:
    - v1.0.1 - no protected calls: every cherax call is a direct call to a documented function, availability checks removed, and clear track stops builds with a cancel flag. faster menu: button colours, text widths and style lists are worked out once instead of every frame.
