-- v1.2.0 parkour courses (learned from deadline duet / car parkour / stunts park maps)
-- Floating railed track islands you jump between. Drive in from the ground on a buried ramp,
-- climb to the start height, then island -> kicker -> gap -> lower island ... and a ramp back
-- down to the ground at the finish. Fall off and you're put back on the last island you reached.
-- Geometry is exact: straights measured from 129 official races (s 17.67 / m 53 / lm 106 / l 159,
-- 23.4 m wide), corners from this script's own proven formation table.
